---
kind: lore
id: mid.bugContest
title: The Wildmoor bug-catching contest (Tuesday, Thursday, Saturday)
---

// The region's flagship recurring event. On contest days (@contestDay) the
// desk at the Wildmoor Preserve takes one entry a day until night falls
// (@midContestOpen, @midContestToday). An entrant has until the bell, the next
// slotStart, to catch bugs; each catch of one of the twelve bug species raises
// caught@mon.<species>, and the best catch counts (run.midContestScore:
// 1 common, 2 fine, 3 rare). At the bell the judges hand out the prizes and
// the desk closes for the entrant until the next contest day.

// ── the desk ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="register" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorContestOfficer" title="Contest desk" priority="20" once="false" when="@midContestOpen && !@midContestToday">
  ::bg{location="wildmoor-contest-desk" time="day"}
  ::actor{character="wildmoorContestOfficer" anchor="center" action="enter"}
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Welcome to the Wildmoor bug-catching contest! It's {{clock.weekdayLabel}}, the nets are out, and the bugs don't know what's coming.
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020"}: The rules: twenty Park Balls, bugs only, and only your best catch counts. You have until the bell. The judges like rare bugs. They like big bugs even more.
  <branch id="midContestEnter" prompt="Enter today's contest? The fee is 500 coins.">
    <choice id="enter" text="Enter (500 coins)" when="run.money >= 500">
      ::set{run.money -= 500}
      ::set{run.midContest = "entered"}
      ::set{run.midContestScore = 0}
      ::set{run.midContestDay = run.day}
      ::give{item="parkBall" qty="20"}
      @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received twenty Park Balls.
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0030"}: Off you go! Listen for the bell. And don't catch the rangers, they bruise.
    </choice>
    <choice id="decline" text="Not today">
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0040"}: Suit yourself. The desk's open until nightfall, if you change your mind.
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<entry id="midContestDeskActive" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorContestOfficer" category="bark" priority="15" when="run.midContest == 'entered'">
  <match subject="run.midContestScore">
    <when is="3..">
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Is that what I think it is in your ball? Don't show me, show the judges! Keep going, or don't. You might not beat that.
    </when>
    <when is="2">
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020"}: A fine catch already. There are rarer ones out in the tall grass, near the old oaks.
    </when>
    <when is="1">
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0030"}: One in the bag! It's a start. The judges have seen a lot of those today.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0040"}: Nothing yet? The bell won't wait. Try the tall grass by the pond.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

<entry id="midContestDeskDone" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorContestOfficer" category="bark" priority="12" when="@midContestToday && run.midContest == 'closed'">
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010"}: One entry a day, I'm afraid. Come back next contest day: Tuesday, Thursday or Saturday.
</entry>

<entry id="midContestDeskNight" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorContestOfficer" category="bark" priority="10" when="@contestDay && @isNight">
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010"}: The contest's over for today. The bugs have gone to bed, and so should you.
</entry>

<entry id="midContestDeskOff" on="talk" target="npc.wildmoorContestOfficer" category="bark">
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010"}: The bug-catching contest runs Tuesdays, Thursdays and Saturdays, morning and afternoon. Today, I'm just a woman at a desk.
</entry>

// ── the catches: one beat per prize tier, over the tier's species kind
//    (schema/areas/mid.schema.yaml); occasion.target is the species caught ──

<beat id="catchRare" on="caught" target="kind:midBugRare" title="Contest catch: rare" priority="20" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered'">
  ::set{run.midContestScore = 3}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A {{occasion.target}}! The nets all around you go still. Somebody whistles.
</beat>

<beat id="catchFine" on="caught" target="kind:midBugFine" title="Contest catch: fine" priority="20" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered'">
  ::set{run.midContestScore = 2 when="run.midContestScore < 2"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A {{occasion.target}}. A fine catch: the judges will want a look at that one.
</beat>

<beat id="catchCommon" on="caught" target="kind:midBugCommon" title="Contest catch: common" priority="20" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered'">
  ::set{run.midContestScore = 1 when="run.midContestScore < 1"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: A {{occasion.target}}. It counts, and the judges have seen plenty of them today.
</beat>

// ── the bell (the slot the entrant registered in has ended) ───────────────

<beat id="judgeFirst" on="slotStart" title="Contest results: first prize" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered' && run.midContestScore >= 3">
  ::sfx{sound="contest-bell"}
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" vo}: That's the bell! Nets down, everyone. The judges have made their decision.
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020" vo}: And first prize goes to... {{userName}}, for a truly magnificent bug! Please collect your Sun Stone at the desk!
  ::set{run.midContestWins += 1}
  ::set{run.midContest = "closed"}
  ::give{item="sunStone"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received a Sun Stone! First prizes so far: {{run.midContestWins}}.
</beat>

<beat id="judgeSecond" on="slotStart" title="Contest results: second prize" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered' && run.midContestScore == 2">
  ::sfx{sound="contest-bell"}
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" vo}: That's the bell! Nets down, everyone. The judges have made their decision.
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020" vo}: Second prize goes to {{userName}}! A very fine bug. Your Everstone is waiting at the desk.
  ::set{run.midContest = "closed"}
  ::give{item="everstone"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received an Everstone.
</beat>

<beat id="judgeThird" on="slotStart" title="Contest results: third prize" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered' && run.midContestScore == 1">
  ::sfx{sound="contest-bell"}
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" vo}: That's the bell! Nets down, everyone. The judges have made their decision.
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020" vo}: Third prize to {{userName}}! Every champion starts somewhere. Usually with a Cocoonix.
  ::set{run.midContest = "closed"}
  ::give{item="silverPowder"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: {{userName}} received some Silver Powder.
</beat>

<beat id="judgeNone" on="slotStart" title="Contest results: no catch" once="false" when="run.midContest == 'entered' && run.midContestScore < 1">
  ::sfx{sound="contest-bell"}
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0010" vo}: That's the bell! Nets down, everyone. The judges have made their decision.
  @wildmoorContestOfficer{code="0020" vo}: And to {{userName}}, who caught nothing at all: a consolation berry, and our deepest sympathy.
  ::set{run.midContest = "closed"}
  ::give{item="oranBerry"}
</beat>
